{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40788","headline":"送僧讲罢归山 · 唐求","name":"送僧讲罢归山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休将如意辩真空，吹尽天花任晓风。\n共看玉蟾三皎洁，独悬金锡一玲珑。\n岩间松桂秋烟白，江上楼台晚日红。\n依旧曹溪念经处，野泉声在草堂东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}